<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST7481"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Rocky<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Rocky<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Tuesday, February 15, 2005 - 4:44 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Analyzer: Thank you for the above information. Wasn&#39;t some of the contents of Ms. Davis&#39; purse found along I-135? Was Ms. Gould&#39;s purse, Id&#39;s etc. ever located? I remember from somewhere that Marine&#39;s license was missing.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
