</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Embersage<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, March 04, 2005 - 12:40 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Linda Shaw was murdered four months after Marine, we know Rader was out killing during this time sorry for the strange post, trying to link the timeline to possible vics.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 10474-->
<!--Post: 10590--><!--Time: 1110040176-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST10590"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Rocky<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Rocky<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Saturday, March 05, 2005 - 8:29 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Johno - your right! Now I&#39;m racking my brain trying to remember if I ever saw his bike. You know now that I give it some more thought - he might have utilized the park behind their houses to hide that bike. Does anyone remember seeing a bike in the pic with the big storage shed? &#40;Not the small one attached to his house&#41;.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
